	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["51B9A72C19F84F0E"]
			description: [
				"The last three parts can also be used as overlays"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An electric motor is a device that converts electrical energy into mechanical energy. Its operating principle is based on electromagnetic induction. When current passes through the motor coil, a force is generated in the magnetic field. This force causes the motor rotor to rotate, thus driving the load to work. Electric motors are widely used in a variety of industrial, commercial and domestic appliances."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An electric piston is an electrically driven reciprocating device that converts the rotational motion of an electric motor into linear reciprocating motion. Such devices can be used in various applications, such as compressors, pneumatic actuators, robotic arms, etc."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A robotic arm is a mechanical device that mimics the functions of a human arm, usually consisting of a series of links and joints, capable of performing a series of complex movements, including rotation, flexion and extension. Robotic arms can be programmed or controlled remotely to perform a variety of tasks such as handling, assembly, welding, spray painting, measuring and exploration."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"A conveyor belt is a type of transportation machinery used to move materials or products from one location to another. It consists of one or more continuous belt-like structures rotating around two rollers that serve as drive and support points. The conveyor belt can run horizontally, inclined or vertically to meet different handling needs."
			]
			id: "2D6BB32B642AE8BA"
			rewards: [{
				id: "544735BB21DE9B9D"
