				"Due to various strange issues of NBT, before making a molecular manipulator, try to avoid writing synthesis models directly with GT tools and protective equipment, and instead use toolless processing models (see the molecular assembly room guide page for details. At this time, put the tools directly into the molecular assembly room to use as a catalyst)"
